{
  "version": 1,
  "project": "wantai-dev/008-virtual-girlfriend",
  "runner": "ubuntu-latest",
  "install": [
    {
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "install",
        "--ignore-scripts",
        "--no-audit",
        "--no-fund"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "eslint",
      "paths": [
        "src/**",
        "app/**",
        "components/**",
        "lib/**",
        "*.js",
        "*.mjs",
        "*.ts",
        "*.tsx",
        "package.json",
        "eslint.config.*"
      ],
      "command": [
        "npm",
        "run",
        "lint"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "typescript",
      "paths": [
        "src/**",
        "app/**",
        "components/**",
        "lib/**",
        "*.ts",
        "*.tsx",
        "tsconfig.json",
        "package.json"
      ],
      "command": [
        "node",
        "node_modules/typescript/bin/tsc",
        "--noEmit"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "命令来源：package.json lint与已声明TypeScript；直接调用本地tsc做不生成产物的静态检查。",
    "当前远端tree无依赖锁文件，npm install不能保证可复现；后续应单独审核并建立锁文件。",
    "根目录test-*.js未证实为隔离离线测试，不执行；不运行真实LLM、Supabase、唤醒、登录或资料写入。未纳入Next构建和功能端到端回归。"
  ]
}
